	(property "Design notes" "7-position, single-row, straight through-hole, 2.54 mm pitch, 0.635 mm square post. Unshrouded and UNPOLARIZED: pin-1 marking and verified cable mapping are required; this is not a keyed connector. Official layout recommends 1.02 mm finished holes. Standard KiCad footprint has 1.00 mm holes; use 1.02 mm nominal or a documented 1.05 mm production nominal and rerun DRC/parity. Pad centers, copper pad size and routing need not change. Lead style 07: 5.84 mm post, 2.54 mm tail. J4 is optional/unconnected unless an existing documented Howland enable connection is available; do not modify the Howland board."
